i di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cu3VNq0hPkwQ7kNvwEn67en&_nc_oc=Ado_gYHNbdRq1Zmk-IPbPzqjGiuoNTpmQe9gbWR8aXuW0VP71Y0SbjKG8CYk1mQifCE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN6B59GHYBIfER3qWhvUeKcdQZ-iBsEBvCMw0uXezKMQw&oe=6ADCAE23"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V2W1drD9DZYQ7kNvwFnTPOR&_nc_oc=AdraaQFV8N1MaqdaVezFfO781htH587CHw2jjP6xI5tf5qZ8bX4wHgq7w0aw40dgkqs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP-8NfM0xl_W9CLGmtDH8jX1ZabWnu-wAdxNOm1wnhbnA&oe=6ADCD25D"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oEUBu1F31uwQ7kNvwHkIXDU&_nc_oc=Adrwre8HwLoyuUzGV2ZqlhvHgWTnoxnz_4RLZ0KCK1Co39mixs81-c6OzLYhaVrcEjg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNIFqAnR2L_UCJQuiY_88I_SFqsLS1OPLpbfUPT_MjCWw&oe=6ADCC0CA"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "im